OL,6,
OL,7,FThe five people killed were all
OL,8,FCatholics: Jack Duffin, 66; Willie
OL,9,FMcManus, 54; Christy Doherty, 52; Peter
OL,10,FMagee, 18; and James Kennedy, 15.
